OL,3,GNEWSAMajor route remains closed after
OL,4,Afatal crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA section of a major route linking the
OL,7,Fmidlands to the south coast remains
OL,8,Fclosed in Oxfordshire after a fatal
OL,9,Fcrash.
OL,11,FThames Valley Police said a man in his
OL,12,F20s had died at the scene on the A34
OL,13,Fbetween Abingdon and the Marcham
OL,14,FInterchange on Friday morning.
OL,16,FThe road remains closed southbound
OL,17,Fbetween the junctions, whilst the
OL,18,Fnorthbound entry slip road at Marcham
OL,19,FInterchange has now fully reopened.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
